   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Every time a new Stan version comes out, is like Christmas. <div>This time I got so excited, a Cholesky upgrade, and yes, the</div><div>optimization went to the right place, or was it Michael tuning</div><div>of the Sampler, or the clean up of code? Big thanks for that!!</div><div><br></div><div>Also sometimes we have to smile. Like X-mas again,</div><div>a thing we don&#39;t want.</div><div>In R while display the run and iterations we had also</div><div>the chain number. And when a simulation went slow,</div><div>we could point at. Ah this chain. </div><div><br></div><div>Andre</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
