   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I just noticed this as well - it&#39;s really annoying not to be able to tell which chain is which.<br><br>OTOH, I get an amazing new warning that I love! &quot;1000 transitions using 10 leapfrog steps per transition would take 2970 seconds. Adjust your expectations accordingly!&quot;</div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
